<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Ms. Bradley,<o:p></o:p=
></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Thank you for confirmi=
ng.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">On item seven, I belie=
ve it falls inside the categories you've already confirmed.<o:p></o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I was not an Oregon re=
sident on March 24, 2026. I held no Oregon license and appeared in no Orego=
n system except Oregon State Parks' volunteer program. My date of birth cou=
ld not have been retrieved from any
 database available to the Department, and it was entered ten days before I=
 provided it.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">It therefore came into=
 the Department from an external source. Whatever carried it &#8212; a comm=
unication, a transmitted record, a query log, or a CAD entry log &#8212; is=
 a record, not an inquiry.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I am not asking the De=
partment to determine the source. I'm asking that the records capable of sh=
owing it be preserved along with the rest.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Kind Regards,<o:p></o:=
p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Robert Samuel White<o:=
p></o:p></span></p>
