<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I received your lette=
r of July 23, 2026 regarding the litigation hold for CAD event SP26-097765.=
 Thank you for confirming the hold and for identifying the standard by whic=
h it operates.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">My case is not resolv=
ed. This message serves as the confirmation your letter requests, and I wil=
l continue to confirm at the intervals you describe.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Because your letter s=
tates the hold applies to any record included in my preservation request, I=
 am setting out that scope explicitly so there is no ambiguity about what i=
s covered. The following are all associated
 with the March 24, 2026 contact at my residence on restricted federal land=
 in the Siltcoos corridor of the Siuslaw National Forest, Lane County, Oreg=
on, reached through a locked gate off Siltcoos Beach Access Road.</span><o:=
p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">1. CAD event SP26-097=
765 in full, including the complete audit trail, all edits, all entries and=
 deletions, all timestamps, all user identifiers, and any field showing whe=
n and by whom my date of birth was entered.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">2. All recorded dispa=
tch communications relating to that event, including radio traffic, telepho=
ne lines, and any recorded call preceding or following it.</span><o:p></o:p=
></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">3. All body-worn came=
ra and in-car video recordings from every officer present or dispatched, in=
 original unedited form, including any footage recorded before arrival and =
after departure from the location.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">4. All incident repor=
ts, supplemental reports, officer notes, and after-action documentation.</s=
pan><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">5. All electronic com=
munications concerning me, this event, my name, my date of birth, my reside=
nce, the domain oprdvolunteerabuse.org, or my online activity, including em=
ail, text messages, and messaging on
 any state or personal device used for state business.</span><o:p></o:p></p=
>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">6. All communications=
 between any Oregon State Police employee and any employee of the Oregon Pa=
rks and Recreation Department, the United States Forest Service, or the Ore=
gon Department of Justice concerning
 me or this event.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">7. Any record reflect=
ing the source of my date of birth and the manner in which it entered any O=
regon State Police system.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">8. Any record reflect=
ing the basis for the event's classification, including unit type, priority=
, call type, and the comment field entry stating the visit was made for the=
 Forest Service.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">9. All records concer=
ning my public records requests PR27478 and PR36445, including internal com=
munications regarding the search conducted, the responses issued, the fee a=
ssessed, and the exemption applied.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">10. All backup copies=
, archived copies, and system snapshots of any of the above.</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">I ask that the hold s=
uspend any automated deletion, overwriting, or retention-schedule dispositi=
on applicable to these categories, including any short retention period gov=
erning body-worn camera footage.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Please confirm that t=
he hold as applied covers this scope, and identify any category listed abov=
e that it does not cover.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Regards,</span><o:p><=
/o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Robert Samuel White</=
